        ["How does it work?","如何使用？","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Hugo, your brand's most efficient support teammate.","Hugo，为你的品牌提供支持的高效 AI 客服。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Identity Verify ensures your users are who they say they are.","Identity Verify 用于验证用户身份。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["If you are having troubles with redirection, you can test sending an email directly to your Crisp address:","如果转发出现问题，可直接向 Crisp 邮箱地址发送一封邮件来测试：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["If you are looking for legal evidence in a case against user abuse, the IP can be useful for further research to be proceeded on that person.","调查用户滥用行为时，IP 地址可以作为进一步调查的线索。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["If you are not willing to share your camera in the call, you can also initiate an audio-only call. Though named Video Calls, the plugin also lets you initiate audio calls.","如果不想打开摄像头，也可以发起语音通话。Video Calls 同时支持这两种通话方式。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["If you would like to change the operator a given conversation was routed to, you can still edit the assigned operator in the conversation, in the user information panel on the right.","如需更换分配的客服，仍可在会话右侧的用户信息栏中修改。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Improve team collaboration by creating shared spaces for specific projects or departments.","为特定项目或部门创建共享空间，方便团队协作。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["In a few clicks, initiate a chat conversation with any visitor on the map, or run a MagicBrowse session to preview your visitor screen.","在地图上点击几次即可发起会话，或通过 MagicBrowse 预览访客屏幕。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["in a near future (you pick the date and time).","你处理某件事。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["In handling customer support on a daily basis, you may find yourself writing often the same responses to similar questions. You have probably been constituting a small database of quick replies to copy and paste to Crisp.","日常客服工作中经常需要回答类似问题。你可能已经收集了一些常用答复，以便复制到 Crisp。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["In handling customer support on a daily[..]","在日常客服工作中……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["in order to generate a response. You can then review the response that the AI generated, and opt to send it as-is, or edit it.","来生成回复。你可以检查生成结果，然后直接发送或编辑。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Install","安裝"],"安装","text","span.c-base-button__label > span"],
        ["Installed","已安装","text",".c-preview-plugin span.c-base-button__label > span"],
        [["Installed Plugins","安裝外掛"],"已安装插件","text","div.c-section-menu-item__label-wrapper > div.c-section-menu-item__label-text"],
        ["Integrate it with your team tools (Slack, Zendesk, etc).","与你的团队工具集成，例如 Slack、Zendesk 等。","text",".c-preview-plugin span.o-markdown.o-markdown-list","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["It","它","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["It is compatible with Slack as well.","也支持与 Slack 配合使用。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["It is smart, and it","它会","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["It uses publicly-available information, and","它会把公开资料","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["JavaScript SDK. Use the","JavaScript SDK 提交邮箱和签名。使用","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["let you create tailored inboxes within your Crisp workspace, helping you manage conversations more efficiently and collaborate effectively with your team.","可在 Crisp 工作区创建专用收件箱，帮助团队更高效地管理会话和协作。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["let you create tailored inboxes within your Crisp workspace, helping you manage conversations more efficiently and collaborate effectively with[..]","可在 Crisp 工作区创建专用收件箱，方便团队管理会话和协作……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Live Translate also automatically translate the messages you send to those users into their native language; both ways!","Live Translate 也会把你发出的消息翻译成对方的语言，支持双向翻译。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Live Translate also automatically translate the messages you send to[..]","Live Translate 也会自动把你发送的消息翻译成对方的语言……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Live Translate is available on all Crisp apps, from Web and Desktop, to Mobile.","Crisp 网页端、桌面端和移动端均可使用 Live Translate。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Live Translate translates messages from your foreign users into a language you speak.","Live Translate 将用户发来的外语消息译成你使用的语言。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Looking for an answer to your question? Use the blazing-fast search engine available on your Helpdesk.","可以用帮助中心的搜索功能快速查找答案。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["MagicBrowse lets you see what your visitors do in realtime on your website.","MagicBrowse 让你实时查看访客在你网站上的操作。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["MagicBrowse provides the following features:","MagicBrowse 提供以下功能：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["MagicReply lets you generate automatic responses to user questions, powered by an AI (Artificial Intelligence).","MagicReply 使用 AI 自动为用户问题生成回复。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["MagicSpeech automatically converts the audio messages that you receive in Crisp into readable text, powered by an AI (Artificial Intelligence).","MagicSpeech 使用 AI 将 Crisp 收到的语音消息转成文字。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Maintain privacy for sensitive conversations with private sub-inboxes.","使用私有子收件箱保护敏感会话。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Manage message shortcuts that you can pre-define in advance, and use in chats to save time on common replies.","预先设置快捷回复，在会话中快速回答常见问题。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Manage your website user data and segment your users.","管理网站的用户资料并为用户分群。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Marketing","市場行銷"],"营销","text","div.c-plugin-item__identity > span.c-plugin-item__category,div.c-section-menu-item__label-wrapper > div.c-section-menu-item__label-text"],
        ["Message Search is available from all Crisp apps, ranging from Web, Desktop to Mobile.","Crisp 网页端、桌面端和移动端均可使用 Message Search。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Message Shortcuts is available from all Crisp apps, ranging from Web, Desktop to Mobile.","Crisp 网页端、桌面端和移动端均可使用 Message Shortcuts。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["messages","消息","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        [["Messaging","訊息傳遞"],"消息","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span,div.c-plugin-item__identity > span.c-plugin-item__category,div.c-section-menu-item__label-wrapper > div.c-section-menu-item__label-text"],
        [["Messaging","訊息傳遞"],"消息","text",".c-preview-plugin h6.u-semibold.u-ellipsis","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["mixes it with the conversation","与当前会话的内容结合起来","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span > span"],
        ["Monitor your applications with a Crisp Status Reporter library (eg. NodeJS apps).","通过 Crisp Status Reporter 库监控应用，例如 Node.js 应用。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Monitor your HTTP, HTTPS and TCP services.","监控 HTTP、HTTPS 和 TCP 服务。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Most languages are supported. Give it a try with your foreign users.","此功能支持多数语言，可以在外语会话中使用。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Need to follow up with a customer later, answer when their business opens, or prepare a note for your team in advance? Write the message while the context is fresh, then choose exactly when Crisp should deliver it.","要稍后跟进客户、在对方营业时答复，或提前给团队写备注？可以趁记忆清楚时写好消息，再指定 Crisp 的发送时间。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Need to follow up with a customer later,[..]","需要稍后跟进客户吗？……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Note that a strong network connection is required for high-quality video calls. Calls work best on unrestricted networks (ie. no firewall, no proxy), though we do provide ways for calls to work flawlessly on more restrictive networks.","高清视频通话需要稳定的网络。通话在不受防火墙或代理限制的网络中效果最好。对限制较多的网络，Crisp 也提供通话支持。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Note that this plugin is subject to daily quota limits. To prevent abuse from large websites, using this feature at a scale which would not be economical for us, we have to limit daily translated messages per-website. Though, you may never hit that fair-use limit set for Live Translate in most use-cases.","此插件对每个网站每天翻译的消息数设有上限，以免用量过大。大多数正常使用情况不会触及上限。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Notes are handy when you need to assist another customer support agent on a given conversation, or if the main agent needs to ask for help.","需要协助同事处理会话，或负责会话的客服需要求助时，可以添加备注。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Notes are handy when you need to assist another customer support[..]","需要协助另一位客服时，备注很有用……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Notes can also be used to share information in a conversation that may be useful at some point in the future.","也可在备注中记录以后可能用到的信息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Notice: due to browser restrictions on audio recording formats, you may not be able to record or play audio on all browsers. This feature generally works well on both Chrome and Firefox.","受浏览器支持的录音格式限制，并非所有浏览器都能录制或播放语音。此功能通常可以在 Chrome 和 Firefox 中使用。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Notice: we don't remove any message from history and keep everything. By enabling this plugin after being a long-term free user, you will still recover old messages.","Crisp 不会从历史记录中移除消息。即使使用免费版已久，启用此插件后仍可以查看旧消息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Often, your chat support agents may express the need to send files to your users, over your chat or email responses. The File Transfer plugin lets you do just that.","客服可能需要通过聊天或电子邮件向用户发送文件。File Transfer 支持这项操作。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Often, your chat support agents may express the need to send files to your users, over your[..]","客服可能需要通过聊天或电子邮件向用户发送文件……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["on chat creation","（创建会话时）","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["On your Crisp dashboard, go to your website settings.","在 Crisp 后台打开网站设置。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Once enabled, a new option will appear at the top of each conversation with a foreign language-speaking user, asking you whether you would like to enable Live Translate or not.","启用后，外语会话顶部会出现选项，询问是否使用 Live Translate。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Once installed, you will be able to send files from your Crisp apps (Web, Desktop and Mobile).","安装后可从 Crisp 网页端、桌面端和移动端发送文件。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Once the plugin is enabled, here's how to setup the email redirect. Please note that you'll need an email address which has support for email redirections.","启用插件后，按以下步骤设置邮件转发。请使用支持邮件转发的地址。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Once you have mapped all the columns that you wish to import, you can proceed the import and wait for it to be complete. This may take a lot of time if you import a huge contact database.","完成字段对应后，可以开始导入。联系人数量较多时，导入可能需要较长时间。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Once you install this plugin, you will get a new menu bar icon available named","安装后，菜单栏中会出现新的入口：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        [["operators","操作員","營運商"],"客服信息","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        [["Others","其他的"],"其他","text","div.c-plugin-item__identity > span.c-plugin-item__category,div.c-section-menu-item__label-wrapper > div.c-section-menu-item__label-text"],
        ["Pending scheduled messages stay visible inside the conversation until they are sent. You can edit the content, choose a new delivery time, send the message immediately, or remove it before dispatch.","定时消息发送前会保留在会话中。可以编辑内容、改期、立即发送或移除。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Permissions","权限","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__scopes-legend > span.c-preview-plugin__scopes-title"],
        ["plan subscriptions","套餐订阅","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Please note that the inbox storage is unlimited for the flat monthly price.","固定月费包含不限量的收件箱存储。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Plugins","外掛"],"插件","text",".c-website-plugins-settings__breadcrumb div.c-content-navigate-breadcrumb__path > a.c-content-navigate-breadcrumb__link,div.c-base-header__headline > div.c-base-header__title,div.c-content-navigate-breadcrumb__path > a.c-content-navigate-breadcrumb__link,div.c-section-menu-accordion__label-wrapper > span.c-section-menu-accordion__label"],
        ["Plugins | Crisp","插件 | Crisp","text","head > title"],
        ["Plus","进阶版","text",".c-preview-plugin .c-base-badge__content,.c-base-badge__content"],
        ["Precise analytics are available in each of the above category, for instance in Contacts you will see a worldwide map of where your users come from, by country. As well as a calendar of the hours of the week when your website gets the most visitors, and more nice statistics.","每一类都提供详细分析。例如，联系人分析可以在世界地图上显示用户所在国家或地区，也可以查看一周中访问量最高的时段。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Prevent users with similar email addresses to message your support.","阻止使用相似邮箱地址的用户发送消息给客服。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Prevent users with the same IP address to open the chatbox.","阻止使用相同 IP 地址的用户打开聊天窗口。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Privacy policy","隱私權政策"],"隐私政策","text","div.c-preview-plugin__link-wrap > a.c-base-link"],
        [["Rating","評分"],"评分","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Read","读取","text",".c-preview-plugin li","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Read & write","读取和写入","text",".c-preview-plugin li","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Record audio messages from Crisp apps, and send them to your users chatbox. Your users will receive a message containing an audio player for them to listen to your voice.","在 Crisp 应用中录制语音，然后发送到访客的聊天窗口。访客可以在消息里播放录音。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Redirect your emails to your Crisp inbox, and reply from there.","将邮件转发到 Crisp 收件箱，并直接在其中回复。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Reply to Facebook Messenger messages from your inbox","在收件箱回复 Facebook Messenger 消息。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Reply to Twitter DM from your team inbox","在团队收件箱回复 Twitter 私信。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Reply to your Instagram DMs from your Inbox","直接在收件箱回复 Instagram 私信。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Route your conversations to specific operators.","将会话分配给指定的客服。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["routing","路由","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Save private notes on your contacts.","为联系人保存私有备注。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Scheduled Messages let you write a message now and have Crisp send it automatically at a future date and time.","Scheduled Messages 可提前编写消息，并让 Crisp 在指定日期和时间自动发送。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Search","搜尋"],"搜索","placeholder","div.c-field-input__container > input.c-field-input__field"],
        ["Search in all your past messages.","搜索所有历史消息。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["See Video","观看视频","text",".c-preview-plugin span.c-base-button__inner > span.c-base-button__label"],
        ["See what your users do live on your website with MagicBrowse.","实时查看用户在你的网站上的操作。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Send and receive files between operators and visitor chats.","在客服与访客的会话中收发文件。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Send audio messages to your visitors.","向访客发送语音消息。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Send private notes messages to your team, in conversation, while chatting with a visitor.","与访客聊天时，在会话中给团队成员发送私有备注。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["sessions","会话","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Set up automatic rules to move conversations to the right sub-inbox based on specific conditions.","设置自动规则，按条件把会话移入相应的子收件箱。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Set where a contact works, where they live, and more.","记录联系人的工作单位、居住地等资料。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["settings","設定"],"设置","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        [["Settings","設定"],"设置","text",".c-preview-plugin span.c-base-button__label","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["Share the same business inbox with all your teammates, under an address hosted on your domain (eg:","使用自己域名下的地址，与团队成员共享业务收件箱（例如：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Share the same business inbox with all your teammates, under an address hosted on your[..]","和团队成员共用一个业务收件箱，使用你自己域名下的地址……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Shared inbox for WhatsApp Business Platform","适用于 WhatsApp Business Platform 的共享收件箱。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["shortcut in chat to lookup your Helpdesk knowledge base from your Crisp apps.","快捷指令，在 Crisp 应用的聊天中查找帮助中心的文章。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Show when something is not working properly on your Crisp Chatbox and Crisp Helpdesk.","显示 Crisp 聊天窗口和帮助中心的故障。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Sign all chatbox email change requests in your backend, and submit both the email and signature easily from your website using the","在后端对聊天窗口的所有邮箱变更请求签名，再通过网站上的","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["signature algorithm to generate the signature.","签名算法生成签名。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Signatures are useful for teams with multiple roles, so that your users can identify who is responsible for what in your company.","签名适合有多种岗位的团队，让用户知道公司里由谁负责哪项工作。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Signatures are useful for teams with multiple roles, so that your users can identify who is[..]","适合有多种岗位的团队，让用户知道由谁负责……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Some benefits of using Crisp with Whatsapp:","将 Crisp 与 WhatsApp 配合使用的优势：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["something","提醒","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["speaks multiple languages","支持多种语言","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span > span"],
        ["Starting from a blank state is usually not convenient. If you already have a CSV file containing all your contacts in a structured format (full name, email, and more), you may import it to Crisp right away.","无需从空白开始。如果 CSV 文件已包含姓名、电子邮箱等联系人信息，可以直接导入 Crisp。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Starting from a blank state is usually not convenient. If you already have a CSV file[..]","无需从空白开始。如果已有 CSV 文件……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["states","状态","text",".c-preview-plugin span.u-semibold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        [["Status","狀態"],"状态","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Status Page is integrated to your Crisp support, and lets you and your users know when downtime occurs.","Status Page 与 Crisp 客服集成，可让你和用户了解何时发生故障。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Status Page is integrated to your Crisp[..]","Status Page 与 Crisp 集成……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Status Page lets you monitor your infrastructure, and report uptime on a public status page for your users.","Status Page 可以监控基础设施，并通过公开状态页向用户展示可用性。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Store all your contacts in Crisp Contacts, and access them from Crisp apps.","将所有联系人保存在 Crisp 联系人中，并从 Crisp 应用访问。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Streamline your workflow by categorizing conversations automatically.","自动归类会话，减少处理步骤。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Sub-Inboxes let you create tailored inboxes within your Crisp workspace, helping you manage conversations more efficiently and collaborate effectively with[..]","子收件箱可在你的 Crisp 工作区中创建专属收件箱，帮助你更高效地管理会话并与团队顺畅协作…","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-plugin-item__summary > span"],
        ["Sub-Inboxes provide the following benefits:","Sub-Inboxes 的用途：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["takes context from your previous messages in the conversation","参考这次会话中的前文","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span > span"],
        [["Teamwork","團隊合作"],"团队协作","text","div.c-plugin-item__identity > span.c-plugin-item__category,div.c-section-menu-item__label-wrapper > div.c-section-menu-item__label-text"],
        [["Terms of use","使用條款"],"使用条款","text","div.c-preview-plugin__link-wrap > a.c-base-link"],
        ["The AI has the following benefits:","AI 提供以下能力：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The Chat Reminder feature enables you to tell Crisp to remind you of","Chat Reminders 可以让 Crisp 按你选择的日期和时间","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The Crisp search system is fuzzy, so that you may make search mistakes and typos, and it will automatically correct your mistakes and find the information you were looking for.","Crisp 支持模糊搜索，即使出现拼写错误，也能找到相关信息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The Customization plugin lets you precisely change each visual detail of your chatbox. From different color variants to texts.","Customization 可细调聊天窗口的每个视觉细节，包括配色和文字。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span"],
        ["The following analytics are available to you:","可以查看以下分析：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["The People plugin is used for the Crisp CRM feature:","People 为 Crisp CRM 提供以下功能：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The People plugin is used for the Crisp CRM feature: * Store all your contacts in Crisp Contacts,[..]","People 为 Crisp CRM 提供联系人管理功能，可在 Crisp 联系人中保存所有联系人……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["The routing plugin is handy for large customer support teams, who receive a massive amount of chats every day:","Routing 适合每天接收大量聊天的大型客服团队：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The Unlimited History plugin reveals those 1 month and older messages in all your Crisp apps.","Unlimited History 会在所有 Crisp 应用中显示一个月以前的消息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["The User Export plugin allows you to export all visitor emails in a CSV file.","User Export 可以将访客电子邮箱导出为 CSV 文件。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["The Visitor IP plugin lets you view visitor IP addresses.","Visitor IP 可以查看访客的 IP 地址。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["The Visitor IP plugin reveals the IP of each of your visitors.","Visitor IP 会显示每位访客的 IP 地址。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["This applies only to Crisp apps, as Crisp chatbox has file transfers already enabled in all plans.","此插件仅适用于 Crisp 应用。所有套餐的访客聊天窗口已经支持文件传输。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["This feature saves you a lot of time, as","此功能可以节省时间，因为","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["This is especially useful if you want to improve your email deliverability, and make your emails look as if they don't come from Crisp. For instance, a campaign email previously sent from:","这有助于提高邮件送达率，也能让邮件显示为由你的品牌发送。例如，以前活动邮件的发件地址是：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["This plugin is useful if you need to build some marketing mailing list based on your Crisp CRM database.","如需从 Crisp CRM 资料库建立营销邮件名单，此插件会很有帮助。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["This plugin is useful if you need to build some marketing mailing list based[..]","如果要根据访客邮箱建立营销邮件名单，此插件会很有帮助……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["This plugin lets you connect a Whatsapp Business Profile to Crisp.","此插件可将 WhatsApp Business 账号连接到 Crisp。","text",".c-preview-plugin span.o-markdown.o-markdown-bold.u-bold","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["This plugin works for you in the background to generate clean analytics of all your users interactions on Crisp.","此插件在后台汇总所有用户在 Crisp 上的互动数据。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["This plugin works for you in the background to generate clean analytics of all your users interactions on Crisp.[..]","此插件在后台汇总用户在 Crisp 上的互动数据……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["to audio messages.","语音消息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["to yours!","成你使用的语言。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Triggers allow to perform chatbox actions in an automated way.","Triggers 可自动执行聊天窗口操作。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span"],
        ["Unblocking a blocked user will clear the three block rules listed above.","解除屏蔽会清除上述三条屏蔽规则。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Uninstall the plugin","卸载插件","text",".c-plugin-item__footer span.c-base-tooltip__value > span.c-base-tooltip__default","/website/:id/plugins/filter/installed"],
        ["Use your Contacts database to send email or chat campaigns.","通过联系人资料库发送电子邮件或聊天活动。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Use your own domain for emails Crisp sends, instead of the default Crisp email domain.","让 Crisp 使用你的域名发送邮件，无需使用默认邮件域名。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Use your own domain for emails Crisp sends, instead of the default Crisp email domain. This is[..]","让 Crisp 使用你的域名发送邮件，无需使用默认邮件域名……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["User Import lets you bulk-import user profiles from a CSV file.","User Import 可以从 CSV 文件批量导入用户资料。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["View a live map of your visitors, and zoom on areas of interest to get a precise area of where your visitors are located.","在实时地图上查看访客，并放大感兴趣的区域，了解访客所在位置。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["View all details","查看完整详情","text","div.c-preview-plugin__link-wrap > a.c-base-link"],
        ["View analytics of all your website data.","查看网站各项数据的分析结果。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["View Details","查看"],"查看详情","text","span.c-base-button__inner > span.c-base-button__label"],
        ["View plugin details","查看插件详情","text",".c-plugin-item__footer span.c-base-tooltip__value > span.c-base-tooltip__default","/website/:id/plugins/filter/installed"],
        ["Visitor Map is one of the most asked-for Crisp feature. It shows a live map of where your website visitors are located right now, and lets you interact with them live.","Visitor Map 是 Crisp 用户最常要求的功能之一。你可以在地图上查看网站访客的实时位置，并与访客互动。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Visitor Map is one of the most[..]","Visitor Map 是 Crisp 用户最常要求的功能之一……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Visitor Profile reveals advanced profile information on your users, in all your Crisp apps.","Visitor Profile 会在各端 Crisp 应用中显示更多用户资料。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Visitor Profile reveals advanced profile information on your users, in all your Crisp[..]","Visitor Profile 会在各端 Crisp 应用中显示更多用户资料……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary"],
        ["Want to quickly send an Helpdesk article to an user of yours over chat? Use the","想在聊天中给用户发送帮助文章？可使用","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        [["Website","網址"],"网站","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__scopes-group > h6"],
        ["What are permissions?","什么是权限？","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__scopes-legend > a.c-base-link"],
        ["What do my agents see?","客服会看到什么？","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["When the plugin is not enabled, we still reveal where your users are located, in a country-wide way. Subscribing to the Visitor Map plugin will let you zoom on a country and see the precise location of your users.","即使未启用此插件，也能查看访客所在国家或地区。订阅 Visitor Map 后可以进一步放大地图查看位置。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["When the reminder triggers, it sends a push notification to your phone, an email to your email address, and a private note in the conversation it was scheduled for. You can also attach a reminder note to be shown when the reminder triggers, eg. \"Call back that user.\".","提醒触发时，系统会发送手机推送和邮件，并在对应会话中留下私有备注。也可以附上一条说明，例如“给这位用户回电”。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["When the scheduled time arrives, Crisp delivers the message through the conversation like a regular message. You can also choose to resolve the conversation after delivery and receive a confirmation notification when the message has been sent.","到了指定时间，Crisp 会像普通消息一样在会话中发送定时消息。也可在发送后将会话标为已解决，并接收发送确认通知。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["When you are willing to block an user from interacting with your customer support, simply click on the red \"Block\" button on the bottom right of a conversation.","若要阻止用户继续联系客服，请点击会话右下角红色的“屏蔽”按钮。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["When you disable the plugin, the profile information does not get removed from Crisp; it gets hidden. Re-installing the plugin will reveal profile information again.","停用只会隐藏资料，不会删除 Crisp 中保存的资料。重新安装插件即可恢复显示。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Whether your visitor is using an IPv4 or IPv6 to connect to Crisp, we will show you this piece of information in the user information section of your conversation with that visitor.","无论访客通过 IPv4 还是 IPv6 连接 Crisp，都可以在会话的用户信息栏查看此信息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["While chatting with a visitor, give a video call right in Crisp.","与访客聊天时，直接在 Crisp 中发起视频通话。","text",".c-plugin-item__summary > span,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["will now be sent from:","现在的发件地址是：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["With a single click on a transcribe button, get transcribed audio text within seconds:","点击转录按钮，几秒内即可看到语音转成的文字：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["With a[..]","只需……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["With Sub-Inboxes, you can:","Sub-Inboxes 可以：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Write","写入","text",".c-preview-plugin li","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["you are having with your user. It is especially knowledgeable if you run a Crisp Helpdesk and wrote extensive help articles about your product or service.","。如果你的 Crisp Helpdesk 有详细的产品或服务文章，它能参考这些信息。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["You can either let the AI write a response from scratch, or auto-complete what you just started to write.","可以让 AI 从头起草回复，也可以让它补全你刚开始写的内容。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["You can either let the AI write a response[..]","你可以让 AI 起草回复……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["You can find instructions on how to get your Crisp email address to configure in your redirection rule:","按以下说明获取 Crisp 邮箱地址，用于配置转发规则：","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["You can now handle all your Whatsapp customers right from Crisp.","现在可以直接在 Crisp 中处理所有 WhatsApp 客户咨询。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text","/website/:id/plugins/filter/all"],
        ["You can then simply download that CSV and use it for whatever purpose you have. Note that the export CSV is not kept on our download servers, and will be removed after some short period of time.","可以下载此 CSV 文件。它只会在下载服务器上保留一小段时间，之后会被移除。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["you can translate it","可以将其翻译","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span > span"],
        ["you do not have to listen","无需收听","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span > span"],
        ["You may also use private notes to mention your team mates on a conversation, and leave them an explanatory note, like","可以在私有备注中提及团队成员，并说明情况，例如","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["You may use this plugin in pair with Dedicated Email IP, which helps you maximize your deliverability by sending emails from a dedicated IP address, that is not shared with anyone. By default, emails are sent from a pooled IP address, shared with other Crisp users.","此插件可以和 Dedicated Email IP 搭配使用，从独享 IP 地址发送邮件，以提高送达率。邮件默认从 Crisp 用户共用的 IP 地址池发出。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Your agents can then see verified or non-verified identities from your Crisp Dashboard, for each conversation. This will help improve the security and safety of your customer support, against identity hijacking.","客服可以在 Crisp 后台查看每次会话的身份验证状态，有助于防范冒用身份。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Your helpdesk is accessible from a public URL, hosted by Crisp and customizable.","帮助中心由 Crisp 托管，可以通过公开网址访问，也支持自定义。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Your helpdesk is accessible from a public URL, hosted by Crisp and[..]","帮助中心由 Crisp 托管，可以通过公开网址访问……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Your Status Page is accessible from a public URL, hosted by Crisp and customizable.","状态页由 Crisp 托管，可以通过公开网址访问，也支持自定义。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Your user is lost? Take control of their mouse and navigate for them on your website, remotely, using your own mouse.","如果用户找不到页面，可以远程操控其鼠标，帮对方找到所需页面。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description-text > span"],
        ["Your visitor receive the call in his chatbox, and can accept the call from there (either refuse or accept).","访客会在聊天窗口中收到来电，并可选择接听或拒绝。","text",".c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"],
        ["Your visitor receive the call in his chatbox, and can accept the call from there (either[..]","访客会在聊天窗口中收到来电，并可接听或拒绝……","text",".c-plugin-item__summary,.c-preview-plugin div.c-preview-plugin__description > div.c-preview-plugin__description-text"]
